@startuml

participant "copy/handle_ref_d2h_copy" as Copy
participant "activity : CudaActivityScope" as Activity
participant CudaActivityGate as Gate

== CudaIPCActorHandle::copy ==

Copy -> Activity: for_operation(&gate)
activate Activity

Activity -> Gate: request activity approval

alt activity approved
    Gate --> Activity: approved
    Activity --> Copy: activity
else context reset / recovery
    Gate --> Activity: rejected
    Activity --> Copy: ContextReset
end

deactivate Activity

note right of Copy
sends message to
CudaIPCActor::handle_message
end note


== CudaIPCActor::handle_h2d_copy ==

Copy -> Activity: generation(gate)
Activity --> Copy: generation
Copy -> Activity: run(gate, generation, worker_id, ...)
Copy -> Copy: ensure_parent_shared_arena_tensor
Copy -> Worker:Operation::H2dCopy
note right of Copy
sends message Operation::H2dCopy to the worker
 containing source tensor arena_offset
end note
Worker -> Worker:validate_arena_tensor_metadata
Worker -> WorkerSharedArena:address (arena_offset)
WorkerSharedArena --> Worker: source_address
@enduml